   └─ this push: naught sent, naught queued; once checked, run the command below with the body piped in

rhx radio.task.push --via gh.issues --into sandpine/svc-lessons --exid 5 --status CLAIMED --description @stdin --promise task-to-public-repo-is-anonymized"
`;

